Package: libfcft4
Version: @DEB_FCFT_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://codeberg.org/dnkl/fcft
Depends: libfreetype6, libfontconfig1, libpixman-1-0, libharfbuzz0b, libutf8proc3
Description: Font loading and glyph rasterization library - runtime
 fcft is a simple library for font loading (via fontconfig) and glyph
 rasterization (via FreeType), with optional HarfBuzz text shaping and
 utf8proc grapheme segmentation. SVG glyphs use a bundled nanosvg. Used by foot.
